{% extends "./layout.njk" %}

{% set pageTitle = "Service unavailable" %}

{% block staticContent %}
  <h1 class="govuk-heading-l">The Accommodation pilot has now ended</h1>

  <p>The current pilot phase of Accommodation service ended on:</p>
  <p class="govuk-body govuk-!-font-weight-bold">11 September 2026</p>

  <h2 class="govuk-heading-s govuk-!-margin-bottom-0">What does this mean?</h2>
  <p class="govuk-body govuk-!-margin-bottom-0">Please use existing business-as-usual processes:</p>
  <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
    <li>Community Accommodation Services (CAS) referral routes</li>
    <li>Duty to Refer (DtR) submission via local authorities and recording via nDelius</li>
    <li>Commissioned Rehabilitative Services (CRS) referrals through Refer and Monitor</li>
    <li>Existing support channels for accommodation-related queries and issues</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="govuk-heading-s govuk-!-margin-bottom-0">What happens next?</h2>
  <p>Thank you for your participation. The learning and feedback gathered from the pilot will help the service move into its next phase, including supporting Sentencing Reform.</p>
  <p>
    If you have any questions, contact your local champion, the London Change Delivery Team or message the
    <a href="{{ supportLinks.accessRequest }}" class="govuk-link" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Accommodation pilot team (opens in Teams)</a>.
  </p>
{% endblock %}
